      "questName": "Email Origin Trace",
      "questDescription": "Samira notices a suspicious ransomware‑style email in your inbox and asks you to determine where it came from. You will extract the message source, import it into EmailTrackerPro, run a trace to identify the final‑hop IP on a map, and inspect the Network WhoIs to record the network registrant. Confirm the findings with a secondary check before submitting the final‑hop IP and registrant for the incident log.",
